msgid "Partly supported"
msgstr "Teilweise unterstützt"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:361
msgid ""
"This build needs TIDAL's own Last.fm key, which Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Diese Version benötigt TIDALs eigenen Last.fm-Schlüssel, den Tidalfast nicht "
"hat."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:365
msgid ""
"It saves TIDAL songs as files, which Tidalfast does not allow (use Download "
"in Tidalfast to listen offline)."
msgstr ""
"Es speichert TIDAL-Songs als Dateien, was Tidalfast nicht erlaubt (nutze "
"Herunterladen in Tidalfast, um offline zu hören)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:369
msgid ""
"It needs TIDAL's own remote control code, which Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Es benötigt TIDALs eigenen Fernsteuerungscode, den Tidalfast nicht hat."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:373
msgid ""
"It sends your TIDAL sign-in to the author's server, which Tidalfast never "
"allows, so its remote control cannot run."
msgstr ""
"Es sendet deine TIDAL-Anmeldung an den Server des Autors, was Tidalfast nie "
"erlaubt, daher kann die Fernsteuerung nicht laufen."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:377
msgid ""
"Its mini player is a separate browser window, which Tidalfast does not "
"include."
msgstr ""
"Der Miniplayer ist ein eigenes Browserfenster, das Tidalfast nicht enthält."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:381
msgid ""
"It needs to listen for media keys across the whole computer, which Tidalfast "
"does not allow (Tidalfast has its own media controls)."
msgstr ""
"Es muss auf Medientasten im ganzen Computer lauschen, was Tidalfast nicht "
"erlaubt (Tidalfast hat eigene Mediensteuerung)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:385
msgid ""
"It plays through the mpv program and talks to it over a channel Tidalfast "
"does not allow."
msgstr ""
"Es spielt über das Programm mpv ab und spricht mit ihm über einen Kanal, den "
"Tidalfast nicht erlaubt."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:389
msgid ""
"It marks playlists inside TIDAL's web \"add to playlist\" window, which "
"Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Es markiert Playlists im Web-Fenster „Zur Playlist hinzufügen“ von TIDAL, "
"das Tidalfast nicht hat."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:393
msgid ""
"It needs a native add-on that Tidalfast cannot load (Tidalfast has its own "
"media controls)."
msgstr ""
"Es benötigt ein natives Add-on, das Tidalfast nicht laden kann (Tidalfast "
"hat eigene Mediensteuerung)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:397
msgid ""
"Last.fm scrobbling needs TIDAL's own Last.fm key, which Tidalfast does not "
"have."
msgstr ""
"Last.fm-Scrobbling benötigt TIDALs eigenen Last.fm-Schlüssel, den Tidalfast "
"nicht hat."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:401
msgid ""
"The lyrics bubble over the player bar works, but its separate lyrics window "
"does not, because that needs a browser engine."
msgstr ""
"Die Songtext-Blase über der Player-Leiste funktioniert, das separate "
"Songtext-Fenster aber nicht, da es eine Browser-Engine benötigt."

